        "title": "Public navigate/initialize docs no longer describe focusability",
        "explanation": "The doc comments on `navigate` and `initialize` still say focusable entities are determined only by the presence of `TabIndex`. With this query change, entities whose InheritedVisibility is false are now excluded too. Callers of the public TabNavigation API get different results than the docs describe.",
